            "notes": "## ROUND 1\ufe0f\u20e3\nWelcome future Lucio mains, today I shall instill within you the power to int and somehow win games\n![Image](https://i.imgur.com/gCHLAQK.jpg \"small\")\n---\n\ud83d\udd0b**POWER:** [Reverb](item_c973a6d8-47ee-4846-adb4-78f40c1b6a9f) \n - Pick the reverb power anytime of the day. The amount of money and peel you can get from this power alone is insane.\n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f**ITEMS:** Depends on the type of playstyle you have, as a base I'd recommend the below\n - [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) - Use this for extra survivability early game and not feed the enemy cash\n - [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) - Crucial for AP and a must have\n - [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) - Gives you additional AP after using ult which is useful mid game\n\nHowever, the other 2 optional items are not bad substitutes so mix and match to your liking!\n - [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) - Use this if you play more defensively\n - [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) - Use this if you want to get beat faster and enable [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) earlier!",
