            "notes": "## ROUND 3\ufe0f\u20e3\nHoly a Lucio player now heals?!?!\n![Image](https://i.imgur.com/PUhDkHU.jpg)\n---\n\ud83d\udd0b**POWER:** [Crowd Pleaser](item_ae569e40-3194-4681-b1da-c664d0fa982c) or  [Let\u2019s Bounce](item_2d846a6e-ff59-4ccc-ae90-c78fad3b4d9b) \n - Pick Crowd Pleaser next for the extra peel and support it gives your allies\n - Pick Let's Bounce if you are convinced the enemy can be dominated, this is however a more high risk high reward pick\n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f**ITEMS:**\n - \u26a0\ufe0f [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) get this  over all other items **(except [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97))** due to how much survivability it gives\n\n\ud83d\udd04**SELL:**\n - If you cannot afford [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) I recommend either selling  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or just getting  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) because survivability will be much needed from round 3\n\n\u2611\ufe0f**OPTIONAL:**\n - [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) buy this if you can afford it to increase heal and boop power\n\n\ud83d\udccc**CLARIFICATION:**\n -  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) ability does not require damage or heals to activate the armor gain only ability usage",
