            "notes": "## ROUND 5\ufe0f\u20e3\nNotes: This is where your true power spikes, enemies be thinking they have the upper hand but 15 seconds in you already have beat. \n![Image](https://i.imgur.com/4AIuva8.jpg \"small\")\n---\n\ud83d\udd0b**POWER:**  [Beat Drop](item_d3d5876b-bd40-4bd9-9954-c65e2295cc2d) \n - Pick Beat Drop **(NOT TO DO THE FUNNY HEAD BEAT ALTHOUGH YOU CAN)** for the 20% ultimate cost reduction which lets you farm beat insanely fast\n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f**ITEMS:**\n -  \u26a0\ufe0f [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) get this to reduce boop + amp it up cooldowns and for the 20% AP\n\n\u2611\ufe0f**OPTIONAL:**\n - [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) - good to prevent **Reinhardt** and **Junkerqueen** specifically from walking up to your allies easily\n - [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) - good to deter enemy **DPS** from breaking through your tank if it is an issue\n -  [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4) buy this if u prioritize cooldown reduction \n - [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) buy this if you can afford it to increase heal and boop power\n\n\ud83d\udd04**SELL:**\n - Sell [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) to make way for other more important powers late game (unless you are broke and can't buy more epic items \ud83e\udd37)",
